    "A sign-in now lasts 30 minutes (`auth/session.ts`), and all 48 tests pass. Pushing needs your permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录有效期改成了 30 分钟（`auth/session.ts`），48 个测试全部通过。推送要你授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
