    "In Jig on your Mac, open Settings → Phone access, click Add iPhone, then scan the QR code it shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上的 Jig 里打开 设置 → 手机访问，点「添加 iPhone」，再扫描出现的二维码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jig": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Jig on iPhone connects to your Mac through a relay, encrypted end to end. Away from your desk, you handle what needs you here: allow operations, answer the sessions' questions and decide on cards, and you can follow and reply to sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 上的 Jig 经中继连接你的 Mac，两端之间端到端加密。离开电脑时，你在这里处理要你做的事：授权操作、回答会话的提问、处理决定卡，也能看会话的进展并回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jig, by Tenon AI": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
